# Suite CodeQL Java TỐI GIẢN — chỉ các query bảo mật giá-trị-cao (giảm thời gian analyze).
# Dùng khi code-scanning (~50-80 query) quá chậm. Chọn theo CWE trọng yếu cho dataset.
- description: "Minimal high-value Java security queries"
- queries: .
  from: codeql/java-queries
- include:
    id:
      - java/sql-injection
      - java/concatenated-sql-query
      - java/xss
      - java/command-line-injection
      - java/path-injection
      - java/unsafe-deserialization
      - java/ssrf
      - java/ldap-injection
      - java/xxe
      - java/spring-disabled-csrf-protection
